]\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2-1-6-2-1\" data-name=\"video title text\">\n                                    Backstreet Boys: Into The Millennium\n                                </strong>\n                                <small class=\"mt-2 truncate text-[8px] font-bold text-white/50\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2-1-6-2-2\" data-name=\"video source label\">\n                                    YouTube video\n                                </small>\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"liner-corner\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2-1-6-3\" data-name=\"corner active marker\">\n                            </span>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"liner-fade pointer-events-none absolute bottom-0 left-0 top-0 z-30 flex w-16 items-center justify-start pl-2 text-white/75\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2-2\" data-name=\"horizontal scroll gradient fade\">\n                        <span class=\"text-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-1-2-6-2-2-1\" data-name=\"scroll arrow icon\">\n                            ‹\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <p class=\"mt-6 max-w-[620px] text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-[#64748b]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3\" data-name=\"event description text\">\n            Explore current live event schedules, verified ticket links and availability across the US. Buy official concert tickets for 2026 tours — every date is cross-checked against the promoter's schedule.\n        </p>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
